{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55286","headline":"赠李昉（题拟） · 李沼","name":"赠李昉（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"反观西里盛，世世秉钧衡。\n（见《增修诗话总龟》卷三引《翰府名谈》。\n）（〖1〗《翰府名谈》：「丞相李文正公昉少年时尝以诗呈叔侍中，览而喜，赠之诗曰〖略〗。\n後文正果大用，诏赐所居爲谢元卿秉钧里。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李沼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}